// PRIMARY: ModExp gas calculation is in revm-precompile (external dependency).
// Reth uses revm v29.0.0 for the MODEXP precompile (address 0x05).
// EIP-7883 (ModExp Gas Cost Increase) and EIP-7823 (Set upper bounds for MODEXP) change gas cost.
// In crates/rpc/rpc-eth-api/src/helpers/config.rs:181:
//   PrecompileId::ModExp => "MODEXP"
// The determinism depends on revm's implementation of EIP-7883 in Osaka hardfork.
// Reth activates Osaka via revm_spec() in crates/ethereum/evm/src/config.rs.

// PRIMARY: multiplication_complexity minimum of 16 is in revm-precompile (EIP-7883 logic).
// EIP-7883 defines: multiplication_complexity = max(16, ceil(max(Bsize, Msize) / 8)^2)
// This is implemented in revm's ModExp precompile for the Osaka hardfork.
// Reth delegates ModExp precompile computation entirely to revm = { version = "29.0.0" }.
// No override in reth source code for this gas function.

// PRIMARY: ModExp gas floor=500 and removal of /3 divisor is in revm-precompile (EIP-7883).
// EIP-7883 formula (Osaka): gas = max(500, multiplication_complexity * iteration_count / 3_removed)
// The /3 divisor from EIP-2565 is removed in EIP-7883; minimum floor is set to 500.
// This is implemented in revm's Osaka-activated ModExp precompile.
// Reth uses revm v29.0.0 and activates Osaka spec via crates/ethereum/evm/src/config.rs.

// PRIMARY: 256-bit integer usage for ModExp gas calculations is in revm-precompile.
// EIP-7823 (Set upper bounds for MODEXP) and EIP-7883 require Bsize, Msize, Esize
// to be bounded (max 8192 bytes per EIP-7823) to prevent overflow.
// The actual integer arithmetic for gas calc uses U256 in revm's ModExp precompile.
// Reth delegates this entirely to revm v29.0.0 with Osaka spec support.

